  "title": "Buying a Business Just for the Job? Yes, Please.",
  "date": "2025-09-30T14:31:08.287Z",
  "content": {
    "text": "96\n\n Buying a Business Just for the Job? Yes, Please.\nSara,\nSome folks buy businesses the way you\u2019d buy an investment property: polish it up, raise the rates, flip it for more.\nOthers? They\u2019re just looking for a really, really good job. And guess what? That\u2019s not only okay\u2014it\u2019s smart.\nI see two big groups who should absolutely buy a business with the goal of running it themselves:\n1. The Relocators\n\nMoving to small-town America? Trading your city commute for a lake view, golf course, or fly-fishing stream? The problem is, high-paying jobs don\u2019t grow on trees in those zip codes.\nBut you know what does exist? That local Main Street accounting firm whose owner is ready to retire. Buy it, and you\u2019re not just getting income; you\u2019re buying your instantaneous ticket into the fabric of the community. That\u2019s priceless.\n2. The \u201cNot-So-Newbies\u201d \n\nIf you\u2019re 22 with no mortgage and zero dependents, sure, bootstrapping a firm from scratch might work. But if you\u2019ve already built a life (and taken on a mortgage) based on making $150K a year, slow growth isn\u2019t cute.\nBuying a firm with an SBA loan means you can step straight into a business that already covers your lifestyle and gives you a platform to grow from. Instead of slogging through 10 years of \u201cgrind,\u201d you start with something that feels like year 11.\nThe takeaway? Buying a business isn\u2019t always about \u201cthe exit.\u201d Sometimes it\u2019s about building a life you actually want to live\u2014today.\nCurious about whether you\u2019re a \u201crelocator\u201d or a \u201cnot-so-newbie\u201d?\n\n \ud83d\udc49 Watch the full video on Dealmakers YouTube here.\nHere\u2019s to building businesses that also build lives,\nSara Sharp\nPartner, SK&S Law Group\nFounder, Deal Academy\n\n For more helpful lessons from Deal Academy, check out our Dealmakers Youtube Channel where you'll find Sara's Weekly Wine Down, where she talks about what she's seen in the industry this week and interviews with M&A Experts and Dealmakers.\nYou can check out some recent Dealmakers YouTube videos by clicking the images below.\n\n Copyright \u00a9 2025\u00a0 Someday Consultants, All rights reserved. \n\n Our e-mail address is:\ninfo@dealacademy.org\n\n Want to change how you receive these emails?\n You can unsubscribe from this list.",
